<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Tool cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Tool cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Illinois Tool Works Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said Illinois Tool has risen 48 percent since Salomon raised it to strong buy in May 1996.</p>
<p>-- said it still expects Illinois Tool to outperform the market, but at a more moderate pace.</p>
<p>-- said believes Illinois Tool will reach $54 to $57 a share in 12 months.</p>
<p>-- Illinois Tool was off 3/8 to 48-5/8.</p>
</text>
